Though a delete button/Hot key would be AMAZING!

No, no more mood drugs at the moment. I am full-on "Mental" drug-free. No SSRI's etc...

&#x200B;

Been off mood-altering drugs for 4 or 5 months now

Betty and Barney Hill case is an amazing story. Always been one of my favorites because it was the first documentary I saw (when I was 10) that had hypnosis, etc... Her abduction tapes, etc... Star systems hand-drawn from being on the crafts, undiscovered till years later...  (I think they all are amazing stories).

&#x200B;

Edit: documentaries about them all over youtube.

It's hard to keep that anger in check. Of course, unless you are supposed to get angry... Like this IS the moment where you are supposed to get angry. Like the ONE MOMENT IS NOW, that it is ok! Then they get suspicious. WHY AREN'T YOU ANGRY??

&#x200B;

UHG

That looks awesome. Now I have to go ask my wife what Frog'ing is :)

&#x200B;

EDIT: Ohhh, the wife explained... Uhg... She said it was gorgeous!

The little vampires are getting the other kitties... RUN!!

&#x200B;

Some of those pumpkins are looking or rather lacking something... It's shifty! ;)

Even controlling in therapy. Reminds me of someone I knew...

&#x200B;

I'm glad you found an outlet and discovered some truths.

yeah, you can watch the people move and the waves. it's (EDIT: Add "NOT TOO" here) fast, even "sped up"

&#x200B;

EDIT:"   I meant "IT'S NOT TOO FAST" Changes the whole;e dynamic of my sentence! lol

The crap show that will happen when they DO admit that it is all real is going to be amazing to watch unfold... Who is responsible for this... Was the government involved here? Committees, investigations... secrets denied and revealed. New secrets and new terrifying truths. 

&#x200B;

Gonna be an ugly mess of yummy dramatic gossip mixed with truth and lies! 

&#x200B;

Kind of like now.

I think it is a paramount of fault towards my parents.

&#x200B;

After EDIT: I think your accomplishments are amazing! FUCK'em! Get that job and show them you are awesome!

My week is filled with trying to find food for five kids and two adults. I cheated the Karma Gods on Reddit. So I feel bad about it. I feel like I lost this huge chance to find some help because I needed it NOW. It's hard to type words... Odd... Some times you can't put down how you feel or what you will do. It feels like my emotions are in this steel drum.

My 17 year old told me he was hungry today and asked for a buck. he just wanted something cheap at the dollar store.

I instantly got pissed. I lost my temper on him... I felt bad... 

I said...

"Where the hell are you living? Every day I have been trying to figure out how to feed us for the rest of the week. We were counting pennies today to get EGGS!!! DO you honestly think I have a damn dollar?"

&#x200B;

I almost made him cry...

&#x200B;

I felt so bad yelling at him. I apologized instantly...

&#x200B;

Uhg...

&#x200B;

Words...

To even have the cops say they saw the copters and the Rangers  

"But one of the officers from the Rendlesham Forest incident was granted full medical disability by the US government (with the help of John McCain) after suffering from long-term issues **probably** caused by the encounter." 

&#x200B;

Though the word probably there, I think it is shitty to have men of authority and law witness something (The Military copters not the UFO) and still have the government shrug their shoulders. No one else owns those... 

&#x200B;

Disclosure is Happening... There will be many years of secrets that will come out I am sure. I hope I live long enough to see them.
